ardText":85,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":77,"alt":46,"copyright":46,"url":80,"id":81,"edit":82},{"width":78,"height":79},1000,670,"singapore.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VnQ5bqstJ98uve_Singapore.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z2VnQ5bqstJ98uve",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"none","Postage to Singapore",[86,91,94],{"type":87,"text":88,"spans":89,"direction":90},"paragraph","As one of the most densely populated cities in the world, Singapore is a bustling and popular location. And it’s made up of 63 islands.",[],"ltr",{"type":87,"text":92,"spans":93,"direction":90},"Shipping from the UK to Singapore takes between 18 and 21 days with Evri. You'll get full tracking to keep tabs on your items throughout their journey and up to £20 free parcel cover included as standard. ",[],{"type":87,"text":95,"spans":96,"direction":90},"We'll give you the same benefits anywhere in the world you're sending. Our international Courier service delivers to 200+ destinations - whether you want to send a parcel to Thailand, or for postage to Malaysia. ",[97,104,106,111],{"start":98,"end":99,"type":100,"data":101},157,182,"hyperlink",{"link_type":36,"url":102,"target":103},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fthailand","_blank",{"start":98,"end":99,"type":105},"strong",{"start":107,"end":108,"type":100,"data":109},191,210,{"link_type":36,"url":110,"target":103},"\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services\u002Fmalaysia",{"start":107,"end":112,"type":105},211,"card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":116,"version":31,"items":117,"primary":132,"id":141,"slice_type":142,"slice_label":46},"2ColumnTableButton",[118,121,123,126,129],{"Col1Content":119,"Col2Content":120},"250g","£12.09",{"Col1Content":122,"Col2Content":120},"500g",{"Col1Content":124,"Col2Content":125},"1kg","£12.69",{"Col1Content":127,"Col2Content":128},"2kg","£16.79",{"Col1Content":130,"Col2Content":131},"5kg+","£28.29",{"SectionTitle":133,"SectionSubtitle":134,"Col1Header":135,"Col2Header":136,"InformationTableButtonUrl":137,"InformationTableButtonText":140,"isTableShort":20},"How much is postage to Singapore from the UK","When you send packages to Singapore, you can be sure you’re getting a great service at a low price with Evri. You can send parcels internationally up to 15kg. See how little it could cost to send:","Parcel weight","Prices from",{"link_type":36,"key":138,"url":139},"fb06fe12-d42a-4e06-b042-a684329afaa1","singapore.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Finternational-send","Send parcels to Singapore","information_table$f82345cd-ef2a-46c0-baee-2cacc12cf155","information_table",{"variation":144,"version":31,"items":145,"primary":208,"id":218,"slice_type":219,"slice_label":46},"3Column",[146,169,188],{"Title":147,"Description":152,"Image":156,"Label":46,"UrlText":150,"Url":164,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":167,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[148],{"type":149,"text":150,"spans":151,"direction":90},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[153],{"type":87,"text":154,"spans":155,"direction":90},"Book your delivery online and head to your local ParcelShop. No printer? No problem. You can print your postage label for free using our in-store devices. We're also in 3,000+ selected Post Offices if you'd like to book with us in person.",[],{"dimensions":157,"alt":159,"copyright":46,"url":160,"id":161,"edit":162},{"width":78,"height":158},667,"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","singapore.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":163,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},470,{"link_type":36,"key":165,"url":166},"fd675a29-47e6-4690-a88b-a098838d7592","\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":168},"Any",{"Title":170,"Description":174,"Image":178,"Label":46,"UrlText":172,"Url":184,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":187,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[171],{"type":149,"text":172,"spans":173},"Lockers",[],[175],{"type":87,"text":176,"spans":177,"direction":90},"Book your delivery online and choose an Evri Locker in your area, all open 24\u002F7. On arrival, scan your barcode and place your parcel inside an available Locker. We'll collect it ready to send on its way.",[],{"dimensions":179,"alt":180,"copyright":46,"url":181,"id":182,"edit":183},{"width":78,"height":158},"Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo.","singapore.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},{"link_type":36,"key":185,"url":186},"5bed1b40-8477-41da-ad8a-fa5e7f09e3fd","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":168},{"Title":189,"Description":193,"Image":197,"Label":46,"UrlText":203,"Url":204,"buttonDataGtmTrack":46,"SecondaryButtonText":46,"SecondaryButtonUrl":207,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":46,"ShowAppDownloadCta":46},[190],{"type":149,"text":191,"spans":192},"Couriers",[],[194],{"type":87,"text":195,"spans":196,"direction":90},"Go online and book a courier collection from your home or office for a door-to-door service. Choose a day that suits you, and we'll give you a 1-hour window for when you can expect us to arrive and collect your parcel.",[],{"dimensions":198,"alt":199,"copyright":46,"url":200,"id":201,"edit":202},{"width":78,"height":158},"An Evri courier is delivering three parcels to a man at his doorstep. He looks pleased to be recieving them","singapore.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdGZbqstJ9-inj_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8036.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdGZbqstJ9-inj",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Courier services",{"link_type":36,"key":205,"url":206},"26b6d8a0-3ea1-44f7-8438-eacef6233691","\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"link_type":168},{"SectionTitle":209,"SectionDescription":214,"theme":46},[210],{"type":211,"text":212,"spans":213},"heading2","How to send to parcels to Singapore from UK",[],[215],{"type":87,"text":216,"spans":217},"At Evri, we offer three methods for sending parcels to Singapore.",[],"article_link_module$380d507a-5f74-4888-80cd-627d9379f8f9","article_link_module",{"variation":221,"version":31,"items":222,"primary":224,"id":249,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":46},"default-slice",[223],{},{"CardImage":225,"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":231,"CardText":232,"ButtonText":246,"ButtonUrl":247,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":226,"alt":227,"copyright":46,"url":228,"id":229,"edit":230},{"width":78,"height":158},"Customer carrying multiple parcels inside a ParcelShop store, ready to drop off for delivery","singapore.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2468.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6R1D5bqstJ9-SOx",{"x":66,"y":66,"zoom":67,"background":68},"Sending multiple parcels to Singapore",[233,236,240,243],{"type":87,"text":234,"spans":235,"direction":90},"When sending multiple marketplace items, our bulk integrations tool makes it quick and easy to manage all your shipping needs. ",[],{"type":237,"text":238,"spans":239,"direction":90},"o-list-item","Log in to your Evri account on our sister site and link your marketplace seller’s account - eBay, Etsy, Amazon, Shopify, or another platform. You can also upload parcels via CSV file.",[],{"type":237,"text":241,"spans":242,"direction":90},"Pack your items, book online, then print your postage label at home or in-store using our Print in ParcelShop device. ",[],{"type":237,"text":244,"spans":245,"direction":90},"Drop off your parcels at any of our 10,000+ ParcelShops and Lockers, or arrange for a courier collection.",[],"Send multiple items",{"link_type":36,"key":248,"url":38},"9d42e542-a131-44a0-8b6d-035d363f7134","card$76879935-3511-477c-94a2-9292bebef45d",{"variation":251,"version":31,"items":252,"primary":254,"id":281,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":46},"cardNoImageWithCta",[253],{},{"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":255,"CardText":256,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":280,"IsEco":20},"What you can and can’t send to Singapore?",[257,265],{"type":87,"text":258,"spans":259,"direction":90},"You can send lots of things to Singapore with Evri, but there are a few limitations to consider. Check our prohibited items list for a full breakdown. ",[260,264],{"start":261,"end":262,"type":100,"data":263},107,128,{"link_type":36,"url":43,"target":103},{"start":261,"end":262,"type":105},{"type":87,"text":266,"spans":267,"direction":90},"Be sure to check the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations and UK Civil Aviation Authority guides to keep up to date with the latest restrictions for sending parcels by air.",[268,273,274,279],{"start":269,"end":270,"type":100,"data":271},21,53,{"link_type":36,"url":272,"target":103},"singapore.html\u002F\u002Fwww.iata.org\u002Fen\u002Fpublications\u002Fdgr\u002F",{"start":269,"end":270,"type":105},{"start":275,"end":276,"type":100,"data":277},58,85,{"link_type":36,"url":278,"target":103},"singapore.html\u002F\u002Fwww.caa.co.uk\u002Fpassengers\u002FBefore-you-fly\u002FBaggage\u002FBanned-items\u002F",{"start":275,"end":276,"type":105},{"link_type":168},"card$8b9d5118-024d-4b2c-ae3b-e430dc424436",{"variation":221,"version":31,"items":283,"primary":285,"id":301,"slice_type":302,"slice_label":46},[284],{},{"title":286,"bodyText":287,"isEco":20,"PaddingTop":20,"PaddingBottom":291,"NoMarginBottom":20,"hasButton":291,"buttonText":140,"buttonLink":292,"image":294},"Customs",[288],{"type":87,"text":289,"spans":290,"direction":90},"When you send a parcel internationally with us, we do all the hard work for you. There's no need to worry about filling in a customs form; all you need to do is fill in the contents information online, and we will take care of the rest.",[],true,{"link_type":36,"key":293,"url":139},"b716f36e-1b01-41bc-bfb6-577a5f2f57a1",{"dimensions":295,"alt":296,"copyright":46,"url":297,"id":298,"edit":299},{"width":78,"height":158},"A side profile view shows an Evri branded lorry is driving along a straight road with an aeroplane that can be seen closely above.","singapore.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ2VIYZbqstJ98uap_EvriInternationalCourierServices.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C2%2C6016%2C4013&w=1000&h=667","Z2VIYZbqstJ98uap",{"x":66,"y":300,"zoom":67,"background":68},2,"feature_banner$fec6b700-8038-4c28-adbf-1702a0b4e9d3","feature_banner",{"variation":251,"version":31,"items":304,"primary":306,"id":338,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":46},[305],{},{"CardAvatar":83,"CardTitle":307,"CardText":308,"ButtonText":46,"ButtonUrl":337,"IsEco":20},"Address format for shipping from UK to Singapore",[309,312,315,319,322,325,328,331,334],{"type":87,"text":310,"spans":311},"When sending parcels to Singapore, you’ll have to tweak the way you write the address depending on whether you’re posting to a high-rise building or not.  ",[],{"type":87,"text":313,"spans":314},"For example:",[],{"type":316,"text":317,"spans":318},"list-item","Name of addressee.",[],{"type":316,"text":320,"spans":321},"Block number and street address",[],{"type":316,"text":323,"spans":324},"#Unit level-unit number followed by the building name",[],{"type":316,"text":326,"spans":327},"SINGAPORE ",[],{"type":316,"text":329,"spans":330},"Postal Code",[],{"type":87,"text":332,"spans":333},"If you’re not sending to a high-rise building, you won’t need the second line, as there won’t be a unit level or number. ",[],{"type":87,"text":335,"spans":336},"But don’t worry, all you need to do is enter the right address information at checkout and we’ll make sure it’s formatted correctly when you print your label.",[],{"link_type":168},"card$6f66a640-ac28-4892-9a46-df43b1ecb324",{"variation":221,"version":31,"items":340,"primary":365,"id":367,"slice_type":368,"slice_label":46},[341,353],{"questionTitle":342,"questionBody":343},"Is there import tax from the UK to Singapore?",[344,347,350],{"type":87,"text":345,"spans":346,"direction":90},"Customs charges depend on the destination, purpose, contents, and value of your parcel.",[],{"type":87,"text":348,"spans":349,"direction":90},"As the sender, the price you pay will cover the delivery service of the parcel.",[],{"type":87,"text":351,"spans":352,"direction":90},"If customs charges are applicable, Evri or the relevant authorities will contact your recipient with a secure payment link to clear customs before they can receive their items.",[],{"questionTitle":354,"questionBody":355},"Can I track my international parcels?",[356],{"type":87,"text":357,"spans":358,"direction":90},"Yes. You can track your international Evri parcel by entering your tracking number on our international tracking page.",[359,364],{"start":360,"end":361,"type":100,"data":362},90,117,{"link_type":36,"url":363,"target":103},"singapore.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":360,"end":361,"type":105},{"title":366},"FAQs about shipping from the UK to Singapore","frequently_asked_questions$f56b3bcb-f085-49a9-845a-5c6496ed53d9","frequently_asked_questions",[29,71,115,143,220,250,282,303,339],["Reactive",371],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":372,"$sclients":438,"$sglobal-basket-count":46,"$sglobal-user-postcode":441},{"abtasty":373,"accessibe":376,"appPromoBanner":379,"autoDivertUpdates":382,"awin":385,"bulkInternational":388,"bulkSendEnabled":391,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":394,"enableBasketCount":397,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":400,"euCustomsDuty":403,"groovyAdvert":406,"newInternationalSendFlow":409,"newinternationalpages":416,"oohPreferenceFlag":420,"opentel":423,"premium":426,"savedCards":429,"smallParcelSize":432,"yourPricesDrawer":435},{"_createdAt":374,"_updatedAt":375,"enabled":2